      "writtenOn": "2022-10-18T18:38:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Interfaces that have network capabilities defined in the config.xml (see config_ethernet_interfaces), cannot be used for tethering. The primary purpose of using the config xml is to restrict interfaces, so yes and no, it is certainly not guaranteed, but it is probably a safe assumption to make.",
