      "writtenOn": "2022-10-18T18:38:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is a reasonable expectation to add to the test. Changing the order of callbacks may break certain apps. TV\u0027s for instance only support one interface in their settings UI. I can\u0027t remember if it\u0027s the first one that\u0027s discovered or just eth0, but either way, changing the older of callbacks could affect an application (however terrible) like that.",
      "parentUuid": "1903deac_7c3c813c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 597,
        "startChar": 8,
